{"4336060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Payload", "steam_appid": 4336060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/2757259a5395bc557ee3eca2c301899f.webp?t=1775818306\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Final Payload — a fast-paced 2D action game where every move counts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a warhead to destroy enemies, avoid guarded zones, and land on platforms to complete missions. With limited fuel, every maneuver is a critical decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.poster.avif?t=1775818306\" width=780 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.webm?t=1775818306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.mp4?t=1775818306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/10e811c3d626db071bc275f9ea391209.webp?t=1775818306\" width=34 height=32 /></span>Final Payload: The Last Weapon — A high-stakes mission to save Earth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the final line of defense against an alien invasion. As the last warhead, you are tasked with precision: destroy enemies, avoid detection, and complete dangerous missions. But be careful — the engine noise can attract enemies hiding in protected zones. Once they hear you, the hunt begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/c67c6930c4ed5cca14c0f1661f4f116c.webp?t=1775818306\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Begin your mission.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start, you will experience a practice run, simulating your first flight. Complete basic tasks like targeting and landing to understand how every move affects your trajectory. Through this practice, you'll learn how your decisions shape the mission ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/bbf64d00e3675217a37739b332ed6838.webp?t=1775818306\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inertia-based Controls: Every move impacts your trajectory. Master the physics to land accurately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Action: Battle enemies, dodge obstacles, and manage your limited fuel to stay in control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guarded Zones: Avoid detection by powerful alien enemies lurking in protected zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack: Unique music that enhances the atmosphere and drives the fast-paced action.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/2757259a5395bc557ee3eca2c301899f.webp?t=1775818306\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Final Payload — a fast-paced 2D action game where every move counts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a warhead to destroy enemies, avoid guarded zones, and land on platforms to complete missions. With limited fuel, every maneuver is a critical decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.poster.avif?t=1775818306\" width=780 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.webm?t=1775818306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/dd53561584c1aca4fd666802e3e17c0e.mp4?t=1775818306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/10e811c3d626db071bc275f9ea391209.webp?t=1775818306\" width=34 height=32 /></span>Final Payload: The Last Weapon — A high-stakes mission to save Earth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the final line of defense against an alien invasion. As the last warhead, you are tasked with precision: destroy enemies, avoid detection, and complete dangerous missions. But be careful — the engine noise can attract enemies hiding in protected zones. Once they hear you, the hunt begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336060/extras/c67c6930c4ed5cca14c0f1661f4f116c.webp?t=1775818306\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Begin your mission.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start, you will experience a practice run, simulating your first flight. Complete basic tasks like targeting and landing to understand how every move affects your trajectory. Through this practice, you'll learn how your decisions shape the mission ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared